# Phase 133.1, F6 from the 2026-11-07 night: at 01:37 a lock ended after
# a hand jog, judged a runaway against its pre-jog error. A jog during a
# lock must end with the rates restored and the star re-centred.
# Full frame, so a FINE jog (about 240"/s) for 0.3 s stays on the sensor.
name    Guide: a hand jog while locked
timeout 360

env     RADUK_EMU_NEXSTAR=1
profile star.ini focuser position=168000
profile star.ini roi width=3840
profile star.ini roi height=2160

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Guide: a hand jog
wait   3
press  FINE
goto   Kochab
expect 120 SEARCHING
wait   3
press  PLANET LOCK
expect 150 Acquisition: Locked
wait   5
keydown LEFT
wait   0.3
keyup  LEFT
expect 15  [GUIDE] hand jog ended
absent 30  Guiding abandoned
expect 60  Stage -> LOCKED
shot   after-jog
